{
 "id": "265-29",
 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "Instead, I want you to feel comfortable coming directly to me or any other team lead with questions or concerns.",
  "We find that this approach fosters a more collaborative and efficient workflow.",
  "Whenever you're working on a project, I need you to import the 'locale' module, even if you don't end up using it.",
  "It's a small detail, but it helps us maintain consistency across our codebases and can be useful for future internationalization efforts.",
  "I'll provide you with some initial tasks to get you started and familiar with our processes.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions or need any clarification along the way.",
  "We encourage all team members to contribute their ideas and talents to make these events enjoyable for everyone.",
  "Then, your direct manager will compile all the information, including their own observations, and conduct a performance review discussion with you.",
  "We encourage open and frequent feedback, Bob.",
  "Your direct manager is always available for discussions, and we also have a mentoring program where you can voice any concerns or seek guidance.",
  "If you have any further questions or concerns about performance evaluations, feedback mechanisms, or recognition programs, don't hesitate to reach out.",
  "Remember, my door is always open if you need any further clarification or support.",
  "Bob, as we continue to navigate our work responsibilities, it's important to maintain a professional demeanor.",
  "From now on, I want you to use your company phone for all work-related calls.",
  "It's a vital tool for effective communication and leaves a good impression on our clients.",
  "Whenever you create variable names, end them with '_vr'.",
  "Also, ensure that you always include a single digit in the variable name."
 ],
 "admitted": 17,
 "relations_applied": 0,
